# Example only: choose ONE cadence after configuring/testing the runtime.
# Use absolute paths for your VPS. Set BENJAMINOS_ROOT and CINEMATECA_CONFIG
# in the operator's cron environment. Configure the named Infisical adapter.
# Daily at 06:15 in the cron daemon's timezone:
# 15 6 * * * /absolute/benjaminos/infrastructure/vps-scripts/cinemateca-sync.sh
# Monthly, first day at 06:15:
# 15 6 1 * * /absolute/benjaminos/infrastructure/vps-scripts/cinemateca-sync.sh
